1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,330
This is the step we're testing to help people turn up.

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,843
People show up for people.

3
00:00:04,843 --> 00:00:07,870
If a lead has seen your face before the call,

4
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:11,200
we expect they're more likely to come, and we measure it.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,621
Answer eight quick questions, typed or spoken.

6
00:00:14,621 --> 00:00:18,633
We write three short scripts in your own words.

7
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:22,200
You pick one and change anything you like.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:29,085
Face a window. Hold the phone at eye level and look at the lens.

9
00:00:29,085 --> 00:00:30,496
Read the teleprompter.

10
00:00:30,496 --> 00:00:35,200
It takes about twenty-five seconds, and one take is fine.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,014
We add captions and your details.

12
00:00:39,014 --> 00:00:41,943
You approve it. That's it.

13
00:00:41,943 --> 00:00:43,700
Ten minutes, once.
